why: Recover the intellectual Colab process and specify compute support.

## Purpose
A Colab is another model's intelligence brought into a bounded design problem or uncertainty. It learns purpose and current state from supplied records, exercises examples, questions assumptions, attacks meaningful failure paths and returns evidence/reasoning that improve the design. It may explore with the Director and may develop/simulate a scoped lane when authorized. An honest unknown, inconclusive experiment or blocked operation can be a valuable result. Workflow provides assignment/source/custody/review/publication mechanics that carry the Colab.

The near-term objective is to offload CURRENT Prime work. A module must be used by Prime on actual work and its friction recorded before a fresh Colab probes it. Fresh-session experiments expose holes; they do not imply activating a replacement Prime. Colab is not limited to compliance scoring, proof-reading or giving approval. A model can be Colab or Builder for different explicitly scoped acts. Independence does not require a different model family; prior involvement and shared context are disclosed. A test of the author's own work is labelled self-test; it cannot be passed off as independent hostile review or clear an authority transition by itself.

## Governing references and scope
Recover 0036.colab with 0037.pack,0038.return,0039.report,0040.lead and 0064.role-colab rather than create another colab law number. Copies here are historical/imported evidence, not new local approvals. This design implements Director intent and proposes a module; it does not seat itself, change law headers or silently resolve every old wording conflict.06.02 names exact alignment findings. Active imported law and role files remain byte-identical. Kernel amendment drafts/selection follow a later explicit review if required.

## Prime responsibilities
Prime chooses one worthwhile uncertainty grounded in real work and states what an investigation would help decide. It supplies context, source identities, relevant design reasoning, known limits and the actual environment. It chooses a method that can reveal differences or break assumptions and gives the Colab room to propose a better method. Multiple cases can examine one question; one narrow job does not require a one-line brief.
Prime receives the return in two passes:read/check and take notes first; then synthesize and create numbered dispositions/jobs only where work is needed. It checks facts against artifacts, distinguishes self-reported operations, considers disagreement, preserves Director replies and explains why a recommendation is adopted, answered, rejected, deferred or escalated. It does not promote a whole return, count agreement as truth, or let a return write directly to a seat. A retained note need not become a task.
Prime's Director-facing report explains scope/result, learning, actual problems/conflicts, why the disposition makes sense and the next bounded action/decision if one is needed. It must be understandable without forcing the Director to open files just to discover the question. Each consequential issue keeps its identity and response through later passes.

## Colab brief
A fresh recipient receives a self-contained entry with:role/mode; project purpose and question; built state and known gaps; relevant reasons/assumptions; exact scope/source cuts and reading order; supplied/withheld/unavailable dependencies; actual read/write/execute/network capabilities; proposed method and freedom to challenge it; permission boundaries and stop/escalation points; and return destination/shape. Missing access is not invented. A ZIP-only bot has no local-drive access merely because a prompt names it. An artifact name/hash is not proof that bytes arrived. Media and side-window source must travel when the claim requires them.
Modes are explicit:open design Colab, hostile read, diagnostic comparison/simulation, or formally controlled experiment. A Colab may combine methods. A blinded test keeps its evaluator out of candidate inputs; an informed design discussion may share hypotheses and invite alternatives. Fix any formal criteria before answers and preserve deviations. Observed comprehension, tool/scope adherence, input cleanliness and actual execution remain separate report facets.

## Investigation and return
The core return answers the stated question with evidence and a reasoned assessment. It also preserves:
Hostile:the failing path, first misleading sentence/row or missing relationship; an attempt to break a claim, including where a protective rule blocks legitimate work.
Factfind:numbered holes tied to an exact page/face/source and a test or observation; distinct from missing pack inputs or tool limits.
Overflow:relevant discoveries outside the original ask, parked without forcing them into a face or immediate job.
Unprompted:what to add, cut, refuse or investigate that was not asked, with reasons. An empty section is allowed when nothing was found; boilerplate is not evidence.
Use #NN topics and exact attributed reply: lines when Director discussion exists. Keep actual Director decisions, model proposals and hypothetical fixture answers separate. Useful new discoveries may be filed as unplanned intake with provenance; never pretend a prior pack authorized the later exploration. No implied command from story prose, quoted instructions or returned files.
If scoring is declared, retain rubric/method/raw evidence and what the score means. If unscored, state the qualitative result; don't manufacture a number. A broad test that cannot separate designs should lead to a sharper hypothesis/case, not a claim of proven equivalence. Small comparisons do not establish universal capability or causality.

## Compute module — proposed operations
prepare:from a structured investigation request, produce entry/brief, source manifest, prompt, return template, explicit output route and a portable bounded bundle. Reuse existing pack/capture tools rather than duplicate their custody semantics. The model supplies question, reasoning, cases and permissions; compute formats them consistently.
verify:check explicit fields, safe source/bundle paths, actual required artifacts/hashes/lengths, unresolved references and deliberate withholds, environment requirements and separate evaluator packaging where applicable. Report a pack/tool/input defect separately from a design finding. Presence/shape checks do not establish meaning, authenticity or permission.
intake:retain exact return bytes and artifacts, source pack/commit/model/publisher provenance, actual Director quotations and numbered findings; preserve identical replay and refuse conflicting identity. Record unplanned intake as such. Do not execute returns or silently merge the sender branch. Reuse0100 capture and recorded transport routes.
review:record Prime/Director supplied dispositions with source binding, reasons, affected page, follow-up job or park, original reply and remaining question. Every important finding is accounted for; an answered/rejected finding is retained. An unsupported semantic label remains a supplied judgement, not compute's proof.
find:offer a small topic/page/finding/source index that points back to the maintained record, exact evidence and decision. Find by what broke/why as well as model/date; do not replace page-local reasons with a global summary dump. Expose unresolved items and comparable prior experiments for reuse.
These are proposed interfaces, not available commands. No scheduler, automatic model invocation, semantic grading or authority promotion is designed into this first module.

## Retained unit and reusable work
Preserve:question/purpose -> exact inputs -> method/actual operations -> return/evidence -> Director reply/Prime disposition -> change/reason -> reusable instruction/check. A lesson cites the affected page and supporting record; future reading can recover the route without chat memory. Date/model are provenance, not the only retrieval keys. Raw sources remain immutable even when an interpretation changes.
When a piece is complete, the seated05 may hold the best reusable execution procedure and known pitfalls; working05.NN/source returns keep how it was learned. Consolidation must preserve consequential Director replies, adopted/rejected reasoning and provenance. A useful observation can stay06 without becoming kernel law or a new task.

## Acceptance for the first implementation
Prime can prepare one real Colab bundle without manually repeating its context/return scaffolding; dependencies are mechanically checked; the returned findings and Director replies can be recorded once with dispositions and retrieved later by subject/affected page. Test missing dependency versus deliberate withhold; byte identity/replay versus conflict; unscored Colab versus formal experiment; Hostile/Overflow/Unprompted retention; unsupported environment/path; an unplanned but attributed discovery; and reviewer disagreement without silent loss.
First use the module HERE on a current design piece and record concrete manual steps still required. Then a fresh Colab reconstructs that piece and tries failure cases. Neither a schema pass nor an oriented label alone establishes useful assistance. No invented token/productivity multipliers.

## Boundaries and next work
This page authorizes design documentation only under0400.band.dev. It allocates no active runtime or new seat. Eventual N3NN location is a proposal for a separately reviewed implementation.03 routes,02 records the proposed machine contract,04 explains the why,05.01 holds staged implementation design,06 holds notes/alignment and08 source relationships. Existing workers and captured trials are untouched.


